{"prompt": "Write a PostgreSQL query returning the top three products by total revenue in each category from sales(category, product, revenue). Return only SQL.", "text": "```sql\nSELECT category, product, total_revenue\nFROM (\n    SELECT category, product, SUM(revenue) AS total_revenue,\n           ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY category ORDER BY SUM(revenue) DESC) AS rn\n    FROM sales\n    GROUP BY category, product\n) t\nWHERE rn <= 3\nORDER BY category, total_revenue DESC;\n```", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 32, "total_tokens": 117, "completion_tokens": 85}, "finish_reason": "stop", "requested_max_tokens": 160, "total_seconds": 6.766924875002587, "ttft_seconds": 1.7291932240041206, "overall_tokens_per_second": 12.561097037443837, "first_content_event_tokens": 1, "content_events": 18, "decode_tokens_per_second": 16.674171198331177}
